<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $85-1/2 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $85-1/2 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-1/8  at $85-1/2 in New York on Friday. It soon fell further to $84-7/8.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 470.20 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
